	"notice": "Connect via USB-C or use the TRS MIDI ports with the correct supplied adapters. Select Launchpad Pro MK3 in the DAW control-surface settings for integrated use. Session, Note, Chord, Custom and Sequencer modes have different assignments. Configure custom layouts in Components. This profile shows the physical grid without borrowing the Launchpad X Programmer-mode map. Select the profile manually if the host does not identify it: no unverified port aliases are supplied. Diagrams are original simplified schematics, not scale drawings. Physical controls without a binding are informational; use MIDI learn for configurable assignments.",
